		    value      	FALSE))
	    quid       	"36BB46B700C7"
	    documentation 	
|This Class defines a Set of Objects by an Interval. 
| * Intervals form a Set, by defining AND and OR.
| * The only prerequisite is an order Relation.
| * 
| * The Interval can be extended by numerical Operations, 
| * because it is a Manifold. 
| * Because of this, you have to redefine the mathematical Operations.
| 
	    
	    superclasses 	(list inheritance_relationship_list
		(object Inheritance_Relationship
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD395700C7"
		    supplier   	"Logical View::BaseCopy::absCopyAble"
		    quidu      	"36BB22B9029F"))
	    operations 	(list Operations
